course: dictionary
lesson: 10020
title: Tenant: renting a home
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some people own the home they live in. Others pay rent to live in a home that belongs to someone else. That person is a tenant, and the owner is the landlord.
explain: Read the clues in «A landlord must keep a rented home safe and fix important things like the heating and leaks, though tenants sometimes have to chase repairs.» The landlord owns the house and fixes it. The tenant lives there and pays rent. Try the swap: "the person who pays rent to live there" fits the word tenant.
explain: A tenant can also be a rare, formal verb: to tenant a place means to live in it as a tenant. You will meet this more in old or grown-up writing than in everyday talk.
fact: A tenant is a person who pays rent to live in a home, flat or building that belongs to someone else.
fact: The landlord is the owner who the tenant pays.
fact: «Tenants' rights» are the things a tenant is allowed to expect from their landlord.
fact: In history, a «tenant farmer» worked land owned by a lord.
fact: In maths problems, a tenant's rent is a regular payment that you can add up over a year.
exercise: Who pays rent to live in a house that belongs to someone else? | The landlord | *The tenant | The neighbour | The council
exercise: «A landlord must keep a rented home safe.» Who owns the house in this sentence? | The tenant | The previous tenants | The children | *The landlord
exercise: Dana says a tenant is the same as a landlord. Is she right? | Yes, they both pay rent | *No, the tenant pays rent to live there and the landlord owns the home | Yes, they both own the house | No, a tenant is a builder
test: In history, a tenant farmer worked land that belonged to whom? | A school | A shop | The sea | *A lord
test: «Tenants who cannot get a repair done may complain more than once.» What might a tenant do if a repair is not done? | Give the house to the landlord | Fix the leaks by themselves | Sell the house | *Complain or ask the council for help
exam: Which word means the owner of a home that a tenant rents? | Tenant | *Landlord | Council | Neighbour
